      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a bit of a shortcut. It\u0027s meant to catch USB PD 3.0 devices. Because Get_Revison/Revision was added in USB PD 3.1 we can just check that the major revision field is zero which we would get if the partner responded to Get_Revision with Not_Supported.",
